id: pm-web-fmby
title: Restore changelog gates with the SDK full-list projection
description: "pm-changelog 2026.10.15 invokes pm list --all --json with unbounded output but without a full projection. SDK 2026.10.19 defaults to brief and emits omission_receipt.has_omissions=true, so changelog:full/check refuse generation even when every row is returned. Forwarding --output-include full makes the list complete but is also forwarded to schema list, which the CLI rejects. Repair the producer integration without disabling completeness checks or rewriting tracker histories; then adopt its reviewed release in the consumer."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-19T07:45:38.238Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-21T19:31:08.867Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-21T19:31:05.986Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-21T19:31:05.986Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "The existing complete-read guard remains enabled; changelog:full and changelog:check pass on SDK 2026.10.19 with custom item types and full item metadata; regression tests cover brief-list omission and schema discovery."
parent: pm-web-8pml
resolution: "Reverified main ca7e188bc91e (unchanged since audit): [PR #223](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-web/pull/223) (8e9cc97) declares the runtime CLI dependency once, adopts 2026.10.19 and restores complete changelog projections through the repaired producer. Retained evidence: test/mutation-replay.test.ts, test/packaging.test.ts, test/sdk-update-automation.test.ts."
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-19T10:12:57.980Z",codex-agent,Adopt the published pm-changelog 2026.10.19-1 producer fix for whole-tracker --full projection. Re-run isolated npm and Bun release checks; compare the four catalog/fleet failures against current origin/main before deciding whether branch code needs a fix. Preserve thresholds and dependency declaration repair. Keep this item open; record producer resolution and exact CI evidence after push.
  "2026-10-19T10:16:17.994Z",codex-agent,"Resolved by producer release pm-changelog 2026.10.19-1 (pm-changelog#256); exact devDependency and lock updated. Both previously failing assertions now pass: verify runs both halves against this checkout and reports through the process streams; main verifies this checkout and reports through the process streams. Catalog investigation: catalog/fleet source and tests are byte-identical to origin/main at 6f3dfe4. In the same sibling-worktree environment, origin/main focused catalog/fleet tests pass 30/34 with the same four failures as this branch. A standalone archive of that exact main source passes 34/34 under the same isolated HOME/Git profile. This confirms environment-only partial/drifting sibling-fleet discovery, already tracked in pm-web-4p94; do not regenerate snapshots or weaken assertions here. Main Daily Release run 39228921300 passed its release job at 73fd391. Keep this item open for orchestrator closure."
  "2026-10-19T10:18:27.710Z",codex-agent,"Producer-only revert proof used a genuine scratch Git checkout, the same SDK 2026.10.19 binary, tracker, verifier source and tests. Selecting pm-changelog 2026.10.15 reproduced exactly the two named verifier failures: 19/21 pass, 2 fail. Selecting 2026.10.19-1 in that same fixture passed 21/21, zero skips. The PM-linked isolated command node --test test/verify-release-changelog-date.test.ts also passed 21/21. No verifier, catalog, fleet snapshot or test threshold was changed."
  "2026-10-19T10:30:37.511Z",codex-agent,"Isolated npm run release:check completed: 669/673 passed, exactly the four origin/main-reproduced catalog/fleet assertions failed, zero skips or cancellations. Both producer-sensitive verifier tests passed in the full run. The command stops at coverage because of those environment-only assertions, so downstream chained stages are not claimed. The required isolated Bun release check is now running; thresholds and assertions remain unchanged."
  "2026-10-19T10:42:02.731Z",codex-agent,"Final local gates: isolated npm run release:check and bun run release:check each pass 669/673, fail exactly the four catalog/fleet assertions reproduced on origin/main, and skip/cancel zero tests. Both formerly failing changelog verifier assertions pass in both full runs. Producer resolution is verified independently by the unchanged 21-test verifier suite and its two-failure old-producer revert. Catalog code, snapshots and thresholds remain untouched. Local strict PM health is true. Regenerate/check the changelog after these final PM writes, commit dependency plus append-only PM evidence, push, and wait for CI at 60-second intervals with a 40-minute cap. Item remains open for orchestrator closure."
